note E14 dominating-check rule (negative): the same dominating check bounds i to 0..63, but the secret store
note goes to c[33 + i] = 33..96, which overlaps [32,40): it must revoke even with e14.
fn f c edit uchar 104 a view uchar 1 i ulong to ulong
t = new uchar 64 0
put t i 1
put c add 33 i get a 0
if eq get c 32 0
ret 0
end
ret 1
end
